the policy in Minsc is published at "https://min.sc/#c=//%20A%20Liana%20inheritance%20wallet:%20the%20wallet%20manager,%20or%20two%20of%20the%20family%20after%20a%20year,%20or%20a%20third%20party%20after%20fifteen%20months%0A//%20The%20Logical%20English%20twin's%20policy%20(InsurLE2/migration/miniscript).%0A$wallet_manager%20=%2002d646504445989a8ccbbdac21b32dde51273c254c22bffe7d7a52ebfb2fd85595;%20%20%20//%20the%20wallet%20manager%20(a%20test%20key:%20the%20source%20names%20no%20key)%0A$spouse%20=%20036707fda5af19cc6aa3a044145cddad5421c31f4167b0b2e026cf1752540e4504;%20%20%20//%20the%20spouse%20(a%20test%20key:%20the%20source%20names%20no%20key)%0A$elder_child%20=%20026b802dc9194db6ae228cbbdab3a72cc46df92e39fe392a50b4298fdf864a24d8;%20%20%20//%20the%20elder%20child%20(a%20test%20key:%20the%20source%20names%20no%20key)%0A$younger_child%20=%200352cb257b56f4e1b7d023ffab1a2e02f80d55b0c9c1fb8061da171a8bf4f2ff12;%20%20%20//%20the%20younger%20child%20(a%20test%20key:%20the%20source%20names%20no%20key)%0A$third_party%20=%2003c4db97ce67acd0a88f7c597a6af2a67892fc2256160e4790b0681cf7e07c63f9;%20%20%20//%20the%20third%20party%20(a%20test%20key:%20the%20source%20names%20no%20key)%0A%0Aor(pk($wallet_manager),or(and(thresh(2,pk($spouse),pk($elder_child),pk($younger_child)),older(52560)),and(pk($third_party),older(65535))))%0A".

the Tape run of 2026-09-14 is published at "https://tape.rewindbitcoin.com/explorer/address/bcrt1qdfgw0ktf7yjw6p9f9trzsc2n62kvttcu9hnfu6sl35cxnaphf46slhfk42".
the text of the Tape run of 2026-09-14 is at "sources/liana_inheritance.chain.json".

% The spending paths of the policy.
rule manager with provenance the Liana README,
        confer "Wallet Manager's key (can always spend)":
the coin can be spent if
    the witness contains a signature by the wallet manager.

rule family with provenance the Liana README,
        confer "Any 2 keys from the owner's spouse and two kids (after 1 year)":
the coin can be spent if
    a number N is the count of each K such that
        a key K is in [the spouse, the elder child, the younger child]
        and the witness contains a signature by K
    and N >= 2
    and the coin has been confirmed for a number M blocks
    and M >= 52560.

rule third_party with provenance the Liana README,
        confer "A third party, in case [all else failed](https://wizardsardine.com/liana/plans#section-safety-net)":
the coin can be spent if
    the witness contains a signature by the third party
    and the coin has been confirmed for a number N blocks
    and N >= 65535.

% The age of the coin, which the relative timelocks (older) measure.
rule coin_age_in_blocks:
the coin has been confirmed for a number N blocks if
    the coin was confirmed in block a height H
    and the spending transaction is in block a height M
    and N = M - H.

scenario path_1 is, as stated in the satisfaction analysis of the policy:
    % spending path 1 — the path needs: a coin 52560 blocks old, a signature by the elder child, a signature by the younger child
    the witness contains a signature by the elder child.
    the witness contains a signature by the younger child.
    the coin was confirmed in block 850000.
    the spending transaction is in block 902560.
    spendable expects answers ["the coin can be spent"].

