scenario lost_the_wallet_manager is, as stated in the flip analysis of the policy:
    % the key of the wallet manager lost, everything else given
    the witness contains a signature by the spouse.
    the witness contains a signature by the elder child.
    the witness contains a signature by the younger child.
    the witness contains a signature by the third party.
    the coin was confirmed in block 850000.
    the spending transaction is in block 915535.
    spendable expects answers ["the coin can be spent"].
    flip_block expects changes [["remove: the coin was confirmed in block 850000"], ["remove: the spending transaction is in block 915535"]].

scenario lost_the_spouse is, as stated in the flip analysis of the policy:
