    the witness contains a signature by the younger child.
    the witness contains a signature by the third party.
    the coin was confirmed in block 850000.
    the spending transaction is in block 915535.
    spendable expects answers ["the coin can be spent"].
    flip_block expects changes [["remove: the coin was confirmed in block 850000", "remove: the witness contains a signature by the wallet manager"], ["remove: the spending transaction is in block 915535", "remove: the witness contains a signature by the wallet manager"]].

